  "description": "The princess, who knew her abilities were extraordinary but knew that she would not become the king, wanted to spend the rest of her life quietly with her maid.\n\nHe touches the maid, and the maid disappears.\n\nThe moment she touches the maid who truly cares for them among those who have spent their entire lives in the palace telling lies for their own benefit, the extraordinary serpent stretches to become a dragon that leaps over the Imoogi to protect his people.\n\n“The princess of the present country will unify the three kingdoms.”\n\nIn a country built with the consideration of God and the kindness of dragons, human greed and power were stained by the dragon's curse, and the war was scheduled to begin with prophecy.\n\nCan a princess really become an emperor?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
